        "original_id": "1dc276f7-243a-52ac-8e70-43cfa67a27a9",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jamal Igle, Geoff Johns, James Robinson, Sterling Gates, Gary Frank, Alex Ross, Renato Guedes, Pete Woods\n- Products: Molly Danger, Supergirl, Firestorm, Superman: New Krypton\n- Companies: DC Comics\n- Topics: comic books, story arcs, superheroes\n\nFacts:\n- Firestorm is the name of several fictional superheroes appearing in American comic books published by DC Comics.\n- Superman: New Krypton is a 2008–2009 Superman story arc published by DC Comics.\n- Superman: New Krypton was written by Geoff Johns, James Robinson, and Sterling Gates, with art by Gary Frank, Alex Ross, Renato Guedes, Jamal Igle, and Pete Woods.\n- Jamal Igle created the comic book series Molly Danger.\n- Jamal Igle is also known for pencilling, inking, and coloring work on books such as Supergirl and Firestorm.",
